  "body": "This lovely home presents a wonderful opportunity to secure a peaceful and highly sought after slice of serenity, right in the heart of Kohimarama. Positioned with natural light in mind, the expansive open-plan layout incorporates two distinct living zones and a spacious dining area, all seamlessly extending out to a sunny, private timber deck - complete with spa pool, and a lush garden beyond boasting fruit trees and a dedicated raised vegetable patch. The kitchen is the central heart of the home, making everyday family life and weekend entertaining effortless. Four spacious bedrooms, two of which have an en-suite, and an additional large family bathroom ensure there is space in abundance for the whole family. Practicality is well covered with a separate laundry, internal-access double garage and additional off-street parking for guests, a trailer, or the boat. \r\n\r\nEnjoy a leisurely stroll to Madill’s Farm, Kohi beach and cafes, the school is a walkway away, along with an easy commute to the CBD. Delivering an enviable blend of modern comfort and low-maintenance living while maintaining a sense of privacy in the bustling modern world, this home is not to be missed.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
